## wizards (three wizards' spots; nested models of what each wizard knows, until wizard 1 can
## guess his own spot) under the world conventions (the shared library, no external environment:
## ^environment none).

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

chunk never
multi-attributes object 20
multi-attributes sib 2

source wizards-world.soar
source wizards-derived.soar
source wizards-operators.soar
source wizards-search-control.soar
